  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2024, UNOPS signed a technical cooperation agreement with the city Belo Horizonte, Brazil, for the development of economic, social, cultural and environmental hubs in the nine regions of the state of Minas Gerais. This includes the preparation of technical studies and plans, in addition to improving public spaces, to assure better lives for all.</narrative>
